@startuml option_b_kg_planning_step
title Option B — KG consultation as pre-LLM planning step

actor User
participant "ask.py\n(CLI)" as CLI
participant "LangGraph\nagent loop" as Agent
participant "Planner\n(new, Python)" as Planner
participant "LLM\n(Gemini)" as LLM
participant "MCP server" as MCP
participant "Fusion tools" as FusionTools
participant "OracleClient" as OracleClient
participant "FusionClient" as FusionClient
participant "Oracle 26ai\n(SPIRE)" as Oracle
participant "Fusion REST" as FusionPod

User -> CLI : reference prompt
CLI -> Agent : run_agent(prompt)

== Planning phase (no LLM yet) ==
Agent -> Planner : plan(prompt)
note right of Planner
  Identify what KG knowledge
  this prompt needs.
  Options for how:
  - keyword match on vocabulary
  - first-pass LLM call to extract
  - embedding similarity (phase 06)
end note

Planner -> OracleClient : SELECT * FROM kg_vocabulary\nWHERE term IN (...prompt tokens)
OracleClient -> Oracle : SQL
Oracle --> OracleClient : vocab matches
Planner -> OracleClient : SELECT * FROM kg_entity\nWHERE entity_name IN (...)
OracleClient -> Oracle : SQL
Oracle --> OracleClient : entity rows
Planner -> OracleClient : SELECT * FROM kg_edge\nWHERE from_entity IN (...) OR to_entity IN (...)
Oracle --> OracleClient : edge rows
Planner -> OracleClient : SELECT * FROM kg_pattern WHERE ...
Oracle --> OracleClient : pattern rows
OracleClient --> Planner : all KG context
Planner -> Planner : format as structured context bundle

Planner --> Agent : KG context bundle (text/JSON)

== Execution phase (LLM-driven, Fusion tools only) ==
Agent -> MCP : load_mcp_tools()
MCP --> Agent : Fusion tools (NO KG tools here)

Agent -> LLM : system_prompt + KG_bundle + user_prompt + Fusion tools
LLM --> Agent : tool_call: search_suppliers_by_country("US")
note right of LLM
  LLM already knows "US" → "US"
  and the join field gotchas
  from the bundle. No KG tool
  calls needed.
end note

Agent -> MCP : invoke search_suppliers_by_country
MCP -> FusionTools : ...
FusionTools -> FusionClient : GET /suppliers?expand=addresses
FusionClient -> FusionPod : HTTPS
FusionPod --> FusionClient : 25 suppliers
FusionClient --> FusionTools : 25 suppliers
FusionTools --> MCP : 25 suppliers
MCP --> Agent : 25 suppliers
Agent -> LLM : updated context

note over LLM, Agent
  More Fusion calls follow,
  but every call is informed
  by the upfront KG bundle.
end note

LLM --> Agent : final_answer
Agent --> CLI : answer text
CLI --> User : printed answer
@enduml